  <metadata>
    <name>Day 5: Paso Robles to Oceano (Quieter inland)</name>
    <desc>Day 5 alternate. Paved throughout, with more back-road miles than the Highway 41 line, but steeper: sustained pitches to about 9 percent. Templeton - Morro Bay - San Luis Obispo - Pismo - Oceano.</desc>
